&lt;p>原文：&lt;a href="https://pkg.go.dev/unicode/utf16@go1.24.2">https://pkg.go.dev/unicode/utf16@go1.24.2&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;p>Package utf16 implements encoding and decoding of UTF-16 sequences.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>​	&lt;code>utf16&lt;/code>包实现了UTF-16序列的编码和解码。&lt;/p>
